2:Tbb0,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.melius.com/blog/melius-summer-internship#article","headline":"My Summer Internship with Melius","description":"Wrapping up my summer engineering internship at Melius. Here is what I got to own, from building agent skills and context to the Playground, plus the team culture, the pre-launch off-site, and what I learned about product engineering and UX.","url":"https://www.melius.com/blog/melius-summer-internship","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.melius.com/blog/melius-summer-internship"},"datePublished":"2026-08-19","dateModified":"2026-08-19","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Melius Team","url":"https://www.melius.com"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://www.melius.com/#organization"},"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.melius.com/#website"},"inLanguage":"en-US","image":"https://www.melius.com/images/blog/melius-summer-internship/cover.webp","timeRequired":"PT7M","wordCount":1415,"articleSection":"Melius News","keywords":"Melius News"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Blog","item":"https://www.melius.com/blog"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"My Summer Internship with Melius","item":"https://www.melius.com/blog/melius-summer-internship"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Melius?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Melius is an agents lab for creatives, marketing teams, and filmmakers. It gives you access to every major image and video model through a single interface, and Mel, its AI agent, handles the tedious work so you can generate whatever you imagine without leaving the app."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the Playground in Melius?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Playground is the fastest way to create in Melius: you describe what you want, pick a model and format, choose how many variations, and hit generate. Under the hood every Playground session is still a real canvas, so nothing you make is throwaway and you can open it in the full canvas whenever you want more control."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are agent skills and context in Melius?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Skills and context are two ways to give Mel instructions. Context is applied automatically on every turn, so it is where team conventions, brand guidelines, and preferences live. Skills are applied selectively when they are relevant to a task, and they can carry reference images alongside written instructions, which makes them useful for things like a product-photography look or keeping a character consistent."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What was it like to intern at Melius?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Interning at Melius meant owning larger projects end to end and shipping directly to customers on a small team. Alongside the engineering there were team dinners and a lot of Super Smash Bros."}}]}]}a:X
f:X
