":"My Summer Internship with Melius"}],["$","meta","16",{"name":"twitter:description","content":"Wrapping up my summer engineering internship at Melius. Here is what I got to own, from building agent skills and context to the Playground, plus the team culture, the pre-launch off-site, and what I learned about product engineering and UX."}],["$","meta","17",{"name":"twitter:image","content":"https://www.melius.com/blog/melius-summer-internship/opengraph-image?961bf8f0fa5edf72"}],["$","meta","18",{"name":"twitter:image:alt","content":"Melius blog post"}],["$","meta","19",{"name":"twitter:image:type","content":"image/png"}],["$","meta","20",{"name":"twitter:image:width","content":"1200"}],["$","meta","21",{"name":"twitter:image:height","content":"630"}],["$","link","22",{"rel":"icon","href":"/icon.png?icon.1w6r-fknzpnk2.png","sizes":"256x256","type":"image/png"}],["$","$L3b","23",{}]]}]}]}],["$","meta",null,{"name":"next-size-adjust","content":""}]]}]
